  "instructions": [
    "1. In a small bowl, mix together peanut sauce and honey.",
    "2. Lay the tortilla flat and spread the peanut sauce mixture evenly across the center.",
    "3. Top with crunchy almonds, diced apples, shredded carrots, and fresh cilantro.",
    "4. Fold the bottom half of the tortilla up over the filling, then fold in the sides.",
    "5. Roll the wrap up tightly and slice in half.",
